        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-3/4\" Extended Lip T Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis \"T\" strike plate has a lip extension of 1-3/4\". It is solid brass and packaged with matching finish #9 x 3/4\" wood screws for easy installation. Extended lip door strike plates are normally used for thick door installations or to protect door jamb trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-TSPE225_size.gif?v=1704354733\" width=\"426\" height=\"246\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Extended Lip T Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Longer length <a href=\"/products/2-1-16-inch-extended-lip-t-strike-plate-deltana-tspe250\"><b>2-1/16 Inch Extended T Strike Plate</b></a> and shorter <a href=\"/products/1-7-16-inch-extended-lip-t-strike-plate-deltana-tspe200\"><b>1-7/16 Inch Extended T Strike Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana TSPE225:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip Extension Length: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TSPE225.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana TSPE225 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
